Z||000000||Ronnie||08-03-2001||03:49 PM||||Just wanted to let everyone know that tomorrow night, Saturday, they're having the monthly cruise-in at the Varsity in Athens,Ga.<BR>If you can make it for a fun time, it starts at 6pm and runs til about 9pm. Door prizes,50/50 tickets,etc. Cost is $5.00 to enter the show, but you don't have to enter.<BR>It's free unless you do enter your car in the show. This is a judged show, not popularity contest. Trophies awarded to top 15 places.Tomorrow night the theme will be Beach Party, featuring good old beach music. Take I-85 north, then 316 East and follow signs to Athens,Ga. Then just take Bus.78 in to town . Varsity will be on your left as you come in towards town.<P>------------------<BR>88GT auto,88Formula T-Top,86GT 4spd<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/3fierossign.jpg"> ||||reg||6
Z||000001||b lo 0||08-04-2001||05:20 PM||||I'M SO THERE!!!!!!!!!!!  Be there at 7 or so.  Look for the goofy guy in the Metallica Sanitarium tour shirt and not in a fiero.<P>------------------<BR><FONT SIZE="1">'85 GT (in progress)<BR>       <IMG SRC="http://www.angelfire.com/ga3/audioimagery/ice.gif">       <BR>White Lightnin!  (NOT moonshine, for all you hillbillies!)</FONT><BR><A HREF="http://www.audioimagery.vstoreauto.com.com" TARGET=_blank>Audio Imagery</A>, budget-priced car audio supplies from people like Monster Cable, Sony & more!||||reg||1
