Z||000003||Ronnie||08-04-2001||10:21 PM||||Hey Songman, the next meeting is next Sat. the 11th. Come on down.<BR>B lo 0, nice meeting you at the cruise-in. Glad you made it to Athens. Hope you enjoyed the show. We've gotta get more Fiero's there!<BR>Felt like we did get alot of lookers at the Formula tho.<P>------------------<BR>88GT auto,88Formula T-Top,86GT 4spd<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/3fierossign.jpg"> ||||reg||6
