Z||000007||Ronnie||08-05-2001||06:04 PM||||Yeah, got it painted and put the new Formula decals on the doors too. Got the decals from Paul McKibben.<BR>Looks pretty darn good if I say so myself!! HeHe.<BR>Was really gonna wait and surprise you at the next meeting.<BR>Didn't win any prizes of course at this show, but of course it's mostly hotrods, but did make a showing and got a lot of looks too.Made some new pictures today , but will have to wait to post them. I don't have a high tech digital camera.<P>------------------<BR>88GT auto,88Formula T-Top,86GT 4spd<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/3fierossign.jpg"> ||||reg||6
Z||000008||Raydar||08-05-2001||09:25 PM||||Glad to hear you got it painted. Looking forward to seeing it. <BR>Maybe we can gather up a crowd and make a big Fiero showing for one of the cruise-ins in the not-too-distant future.<BR>Would also like to do the Dalton thing. <BR><P>------------------<BR>Raydar - aka Steve<BR><FONT SIZE="1"><BR>Black 88 Formula.<BR>Red 88 Duke coupe. "The Project" <BR>88 Formula parts car. "The Donor"<BR></FONT>||||reg||1
