Z||000013||Raydar||08-06-2001||02:14 PM||||Our meetings are the second Saturday of each month. <BR>Might be better to do it on an alternate day. Most of the club is, unfortunately, not on the Forum. Including the president. <P>Dale, Where are you thinking of doing this?<P>------------------<BR>Raydar - aka Steve<BR><FONT SIZE="1"><BR>Black 88 Formula.<BR>Red 88 Duke coupe. "The Project" <BR>88 Formula parts car. "The Donor"<BR></FONT>||||reg||1
Z||000014||Songman||08-06-2001||05:14 PM||||Well, there are tons of places around Dalton we could do it... we could get a room at a restaurant there somewhere right off of the Walnut Avenue exit so people could find it... Then maybe we could take a cruise up Fort Mountain or something.<P>Our club is still new and we are still trying to work out how to do our meetings. I'm open to suggestions on what kind of things should happen if we have an event like this...<P>I was thinking about doing it sometime in September but the Run For The Hills is in September so that is another weekend tied up. Not sure how many people are willing to take too many weekend jaunts.<P>Throw some input out here and we'll put it together. It sounds like lots of fun!<P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/songman_1.gif"> <BR><A HREF="http://members.home.com/tnfieros" TARGET=_blank>Tennessee Fiero Owners</A>||||reg||10
